{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/New_Project_-_2025-06-02T221234.138.png?t=1750760922\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/waving__1_.gif?t=1750760922\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cozy farming-adventure in a vibrant post-apocalypse, where your days are spent planting and trading and your nights defending your sanctuary against the unfed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/GROW_AND_SELL_YOUR_CROPS!.png?t=1750760922\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/growing__1_.gif?t=1750760922\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Rory, an aging farmer determined to feed the last survivors. Cultivate a variety of crops and sell your harvest to earn increasingly prestigious currencies. Spend your earnings on unlocking new seed types, expanding crop plots and improving growth efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/BUT_BEWARE_OF_THE_NIGHT.png?t=1750760922\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/Door__1_.gif?t=1750760922\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the sun sets, waves of zombies rise and attack from midnight until dawn. Craft defenses from salvaged materials\u2014barricades, automated turrets, combat bots and traps\u2014and adapt your strategy as the threat grows each night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/AUTOMATE_YOUR_PRODUCTION.png?t=1750760922\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/robot__1_.gif?t=1750760922\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design and deploy farming and watering robots to handle planting, irrigation and harvesting. Build water stations and sprinklers to keep fields hydrated, freeing Rory to focus on expansion and decoration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/CUSTOMIZE_AND_CREATE_YOUR_HOME.png?t=1750760922\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/decorations__1_.gif?t=1750760922\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform your farm into a personal haven. Reinforce structures, apply decorative finishes and watch your central Tree of Progress grow with every upgrade\u2014an organic record of your journey from lone farmer to humanity\u2019s last hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3783050?t=1750760922","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/0a532f4c94a8cdd013bd3ff56c613d37143318ba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750760922","ca